###

### Registro tutor (siempre por Auth Service)
### Nota: Degree (no Grade). Role: tutor
POST {{authHost}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tutor Demo",
  "email": "tutor.demo@mail.com",
  "password": "TutorDemo123!",
  "age": 40,
  "genre": "M",
  "country": "MX",
  "role": "tutor",
  "degree": "maestria"
}

###

### Registro estudiante (siempre por Auth Service)
### Nota: si luego quieres asignarlo, usa /tutors/assign-student con JWT de tutor
POST {{authHost}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Student Demo",
  "email": "student.demo@mail.com",
  "password": "StudentDemo123!",
  "age": 14,
  "genre": "F",
  "country": "MX",
  "role": "student",
  "neurodivergency": "ADHD"
}

###

### Asignar estudiante a tutor (requiere JWT de ese tutor)
@tutor47Token = <PEGAR_TOKEN_TUTOR_47>
POST {{figuresHost}}/tutors/assign-student
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentEmail": "student.demo@mail.com",
  "tutorEmail": "juan.garcia@mail.com"
}

